# Change plans

Use a change plan for work with multiple dependent steps, architecture or security
impact, migration risk, or a meaningful rollback requirement. Small, low-risk fixes can
state acceptance criteria directly in the pull request.

Create plans from [the template](0000-template.md), name them after the outcome, and
remove or archive completed plans according to repository policy.
